# Production build: the gateway serves this bundle same-origin from dashboard/dist, so
# every dashboard URL must be relative. Keep VITE_API_BASE_URL empty here: an empty
# base makes apiBase() return "" (same-origin). Vite loads .env in ALL modes, including
# `vite build`, so this mode-specific file overrides any localhost value left in .env.
# Do NOT set a host here; a full host would bake an absolute URL into the shipped assets.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
